### RENDER - PLAYLISTS

### 1. Get all playlists (Success 200)
GET https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/playlists

### 2. Get playlist by ID (Success 200) - Jazz Playlist
GET https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/playlists/6ad1a123a6238671da0fb676

### 3. Get playlist by ID (Error 400 CastError) - Invalid ID format
GET https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/playlists/123

### 4. Get playlist by ID (Error 404 Not Found) - Valid format but doesn't exist
GET https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/playlists/000000000000000000000000

### 5. Create playlist (Success 201)
POST https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/playlists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Folk Essentials",
  "description": "Acoustic stories and timeless melodies — my favorite folk tracks",
  "creator": "Jesus Tortolero",
  "genre": "folk",
  "songs": [
    "Blowin' in the Wind - Bob Dylan",
    "The Sound of Silence - Simon & Garfunkel"
  ],
  "isPublic": true,
  "coverImage": "https://picsum.photos/400/400?random=7"
}

### 6. Create playlist (Error 400 Validation) - Missing 'creator' and short 'name'
POST https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/playlists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hi",
  "genre": "folk",
  "songs": []
}

### 7. Create playlist (Error 400 Validation) - Invalid genre
POST https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/playlists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "My Playlist",
  "creator": "Jesus",
  "genre": "heavy-metal" 
}

### 8. Update playlist (Success 200) - Updating Jazz Playlist
PUT https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/playlists/6ad1a123a6238671da0fb676
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jazz for Studying - Masterpiece Edition"
}

### 9. Update playlist (Error 404) - Non-existent ID
PUT https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/playlists/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "This will fail"
}

### 10. Delete playlist (Success 200) - Deleting "My Awesome Playlist"
DELETE https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/playlists/6ad6cc95ca7403d6e432f500

### 11. Delete playlist (Error 404) - Non-existent ID
DELETE https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/playlists/000000000000000000000000